      "id": "b7d2c1e0-4f6a-4c8e-9a1d-3e5f7a9b0c21",
      "description": "Routing on the digits the caller pressed in the IVR menu (the optional dtmfInput field).\n\nThese requests need one menu rule in the database: pressing 1 on the billing line goes to a payments queue. Create it once in an IntelliJ query console:\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO queues (name) VALUES ('payments');\n\nINSERT INTO routing_rules (name, priority, dialed_number, dtmf_input, target_queue_id)\nVALUES ('Billing menu: 1 for payments', 15, '+18005550100', '1',\n        (SELECT id FROM queues WHERE name = 'payments'));\n```\n\nWait up to 30 seconds for the rule cache to reload before running the folder. Run the first three requests in order; the rest are independent."
    }
